ack to the importance of this election in determining the future of Britain, as we head into the negotiations rooms with Brussels." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5261, "fields": { "question": 1074, "description": "There is no need to complicate things. As we’ve moved later into this campaign, issues surrounding national security have taken the front and centre position in Britain’s wider conversation. Let’s keep discussing what we will do to make Britain safer." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5262, "fields": { "question": 1074, "description": "That’s good to hear, it might give us a small boost in Scotland, so let’s use this appeal to our advantage up there." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5263, "fields": { "question": 1074, "description": "Being too progressive might risk alienating some of our older voters and the crucial voters we need to win in the Red Wall, many of which are more socially conservative than the average voter. Let’s try to strike a more socially conservative tone." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5264, "fields": { "question": 1075, "description": "There is no need to complicate things. Our strongest issue is Brexit, and in the closing week of the campaign, let’s circle back to the importance of this election in determining the future of Britain, as we head into the negotiations rooms with Brussels." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5265, "fields": { "question": 1075, "description": "There is no need to complicate things. As we’ve moved later into this campaign, issues surrounding national security have taken the front and centre position in Britain’s wider conversation. Let’s keep discussing what we will do to make Britain safer." } }, { "model": "campaign_trail.answer", "pk": 5266, "fields": { "question": 1075, "description": "It’s good to hear that the Traditionalist wing of the party are behind us and we’ll have a united party moving forwards into the closing days of